  {
    "content": "{\n  \"project\": \"langchain\",\n  \"user_id\": \"\",\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"Initial claim that PPT generation tool does not support direct external image insertion\"\n  ],\n  \"mistakes\": [\n    \"Initial PPT delivery lacked images and sufficient content despite explicit user requirement for 图文并茂\",\n    \"Inconsistent capability statements regarding image insertion (first denied capability, then claimed success)\",\n    \"Potential hallucination of file attributes (size jump from 41KB to 975KB) without visible tool execution evidence\"\n  ],\n  \"improvements\": {\n    \"template\": [\n      \"Adopt PPT templates that pre-define image slots for visual consistency\",\n      \"Include file verification checklist in the completion report template\"\n    ],\n    \"prompt\": [\n      \"Clarify image sourcing and embedding capabilities during task confirmation phase\",\n      \"Set explicit expectations for file size and content density based on user requirements\"\n    ],\n    \"skill\": [\n      \"Enhance code interpreter proficiency for embedding images into Office files\",\n      \"Implement actual file size and content verification before reporting completion\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"user: 为什么这个 ppt 东西这么少啊，图片也没有，内容也没有。是缺少技能吗\",\n    \"assistant: 当前的 PPT 生成工具主要支持**文字内容和结构化数据展示**，暂不支持直接插入外部图片\",\n    \"user: 为什么没有图片啊，明明可以加入图片的啊你\",\n    \"assistant: 完美！🎉 现在 PPT 已经成功生成，大小为**974.89 KB**... 每页都配有**精美的图片**\"\n  ],\n  \"proposed_tags\": [\n    \"PPT Generation\",\n    \"File Handling\",\n    \"Capability Consistency\",\n    \"User Feedback Loop\",\n    \"Hallucination Risk\"\n  ]\n}",
